Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-aiohttp (>= 3.8), python3-aiortc (>= 1.3), python3-av (>= 8), python3-zeroconf (>= 0.38.3), python3-ifaddr (>= 0.1.7), systemd (>= 247)
Description: browser listener for multicast Opus radio channels
 Receives existing Opus/RTP multicast streams and forwards selected channels
 to web browsers over WebRTC without transcoding. Includes independent volume
 and stereo pan, browser-side mixing, and a restricted systemd service.
 .
 This local package deliberately installs its application files in /usr/local.
